farmerspizzeria.book.basil_leaves.description=§rBasil Leaves can be obtained by breaking basil crops and wild basil. Wild basil generates in Jungle and Forest biomes
farmerspizzeria.book.pizza_process.description=§r1. Prepare dough, tomato sauce, and toppings\n2. Place dough and roll it into a round base with a rolling pin\n3. Spread tomato sauce evenly on the crust\n4. Add desired toppings\n5. Bake pizza in a smoker\n6. Take out pizza, slice and enjoy
farmerspizzeria.book.carbonara_pizza.description=§rOther required toppings for this pizza are Flaxen Cheese Wedge, Bacon, and Egg
farmerspizzeria.book.meat_feast_pizza.description=§rOther required toppings for this pizza are Flaxen Cheese Wedge, Bacon, Salami, and Ham
farmerspizzeria.book.pepperoni_pizza.description=§rOther required toppings for this pizza are Flaxen Cheese Wedge and Salami
farmerspizzeria.book.cheese_pizza.description=§rOther required toppings for this pizza are Flaxen Cheese Wedge, Scarlet Cheese Wedge, and Dorblu Cheese
farmerspizzeria.book.margarita_pizza.description=§rOther required toppings for this pizza are Flaxen Cheese Wedge, Tomato, and Basil Leaves
farmerspizzeria.book.funghi_pizza.description=§rOther required toppings for this pizza are Flaxen Cheese Wedge, Tomato, Brown Mushroom, and Basil Leaves
farmerspizzeria.book.thanks.description=Special thanks to §o§hdmn_alex§r for creating this wonderful mod, and it is a great honor to receive permission to port it.